# The mod list is a declaration and stays a file (ADR-0028): one pinned entry
# per line, <curseforge-slug>:<fileId>. A CurseForge file id names one immutable
# upload, so the pin is real. "Newest" is a proposal's job, never this file's.
#
# Blank lines and #-comments are ignored. Editing this list changes nothing by
# itself: scripts/cut-release.sh resolves it into an immutable release, and
# only a promotion deploys one.

